		margin-top: 12rpx;
		font-size: 21rpx;
		color: #8D817B;
	}

	.form-card,
	.setting-card {
		margin: 18rpx 32rpx 0;
		padding: 26rpx;
		background-color: #FFFFFF;
		border: 1rpx solid #F5DED5;
